time of writing that lockfile pins exactly three non-development packages. npm
installs each package's own LICENSE file unmodified; those files are not edited,
shortened or replaced by CrewDispatch. The paths below are relative to the install root.

  @modelcontextprotocol/core    2.1.0   node_modules/@modelcontextprotocol/core/LICENSE
  @modelcontextprotocol/server  2.1.0   node_modules/@modelcontextprotocol/server/LICENSE
  zod                           4.2.0   node_modules/zod/LICENSE

