3. External prerequisites — not bundled, no license text shipped here
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Command Code CLI / app       user-installed provider software. Never copied, bundled,
                               installed or redistributed by CrewDispatch; its own terms
                               apply between the user and its provider.
  WorkBuddy AI app / CLI       user-installed provider software. Never copied, bundled,
                               installed or redistributed by CrewDispatch; its own terms
                               apply between the user and its provider.
  Node.js >= 22 and npm        required to run the installer and the product; the
                               platform install is not vendored.
  TypeScript, @types/node,     development dependencies only; `npm ci --omit=dev`
  undici-types                 does not install them into the staged package.

No fonts, icons, images or other third-party assets are bundled. No credentials,
provider databases or user data of any CLI are copied into the package.
